WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.224
Time-out: tap the team's "TO" box.

2
00:00:03.274 --> 00:00:07.308
"Confirm" starts the 30 seconds.

3
00:00:07.358 --> 00:00:09.581
"Stop timeout" ends it early.

4
00:00:09.631 --> 00:00:11.856
Substitution: tap the team's "Substitution" box.

5
00:00:11.906 --> 00:00:16.260
First the player who comes in (bench), then the one who goes out (court).

6
00:00:16.310 --> 00:00:19.011
Check the pair, then "Confirm".

7
00:00:19.061 --> 00:00:22.289
Number 9 is on court, the "Substitution" box shows 1.

8
00:00:22.339 --> 00:00:26.061
Next rally: B wins it, A receives.

9
00:00:26.111 --> 00:00:32.209
Libero: tap a back-row player, then "Libero" and the libero.

10
00:00:32.259 --> 00:00:34.621
The libero is on court, without a substitution.

11
00:00:34.671 --> 00:00:37.221
At the rotation to the front row, the libero goes out by itself.
